    "breadcrumb": "Swing Catalyst Support \u003e Software \u0026 Features",
    "content": "Swing Catalyst \u0026 Motion Catalyst supports a number of keyboard shortcuts.\nThis article details the keyboard shortcuts.\nA keyboard shortcut can be just one keyboard press but also a combination of presses.\nIn this article shortcuts that are longer than just one keyboard press are strung together using + .\nThis does not mean you need to press + on the keyboard, but it indicates you need to press both (or more) buttons together.\nPlayback Keyboard hotkey / shortcut Action\nSpace Toggle play / pause\nRight Step one frame forward\nLeft Step one frame backward\nShift Right Step 5% of the duration forward\nShift Left Step 5% of the duration backward\nUp Increase playback speed\nDown Decrease playback speed\nBookmarks Keyboard hotkey / shortcut Action / description\n1,2 or 3 Go to position of bookmark(s) 1 to 3 of the recording open in View Port A\nAlt + 1, 2 or 3 Go to position of bookmark(s) 1 to 3 of the recording open in View Port B\nCtrl + 1, 2 or 3 Set bookmark 1 to 3 in View Port A to current playback position\nCtrl + Alt 1, 2 or 3 Set bookmark 1 to 3 in View Port B to current playback position\nCtrl + Shift 1, 2 or 3 Synchronize on bookmark 1-3\nCtrl +B Lock / unlock bookmarks for editing\nDrawing tools Hotkey Action (enables the drawing tool)\nC Circle\nR **Rectangle **\nV **Arrow **\nL Line\nA Angle\nF Freehand\nS Sway\nE Eraser\nH Hand\nT Text\nB Bucket (erase all)\nMotion Capture Hotkey Action\nShift+S Toggle hide skeleton\nShift+C Toggle hide center of mass symbol\nShift+A Toggle angle tool\nShift+L Toggle connect joint tool\nShift+T Toggle trace joint tool\nShift+M Toggle move joint tool\nOther Hotkey Action / description\nCtrl + O Open / close Explorer\nCtrl + Mouse Scroll Up Zoom in (video or data graph, depending on mouse focus\nCtrl + Mouse Scroll Down Zoom out (video or graph data, depending on mouse focus)\nAlt + C Toggle capture mode (once you have selected a user)\nAlt + A Open last recording in the stack in View Port a\nAlt + B Open last recording in the stack in View Port B",
    "description": "Complete list of keyboard shortcuts and hotkeys available in Swing Catalyst software",
    "tags": [
      "Motion-Capture"
    ],
    "title": "Keyboard shortcuts and Hotkeys",
    "uri": "/sc-support/en/software-features/keyboard-shortcuts/index.html"
